WEBVTT

00:00:12.468 --> 00:00:14.679
Everyone assemble on the forward deck.

00:00:15.262 --> 00:00:18.933
We are arriving
at our final destination.

00:00:19.016 --> 00:00:20.768
From the depths of creation,

00:00:20.851 --> 00:00:23.771
the mighty city has risen once again.

00:00:24.522 --> 00:00:27.525
Home to the greatest
monster civilization

00:00:27.608 --> 00:00:28.943
the world has ever known,

00:00:29.026 --> 00:00:33.948
far surpassing Athens and Rome
in art, culture and sophistication.

00:00:34.031 --> 00:00:39.203
I give you
the legendary lost city of Atlantis.

00:01:04.854 --> 00:01:06.355
It's a giant Kraken!

00:01:07.565 --> 00:01:10.317
There's a place you've gotta be

00:01:10.401 --> 00:01:13.738
A thousand leagues beneath the sea

00:01:13.821 --> 00:01:18.617
And it's waiting over here
for you and me

00:01:20.077 --> 00:01:23.080
Gonna take you for a ride

00:01:23.164 --> 00:01:26.417
But first you've gotta come inside

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.755
Get ready, for the party's on tonight

00:01:31.547 --> 00:01:35.718
So relax and just unwind

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:39.096
Leave your worries all behind

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.392
And get ready,
for the party's on tonight

00:01:53.652 --> 00:01:56.530
Welcome to Atlantis!

00:01:56.614 --> 00:01:59.158
So get ready

00:01:59.241 --> 00:02:01.410
Ready

00:02:03.496 --> 00:02:07.458
It's party time

00:02:12.755 --> 00:02:14.423
It's party time!

00:02:17.259 --> 00:02:18.719
I am so excited!

00:02:19.053 --> 00:02:20.054
Come to Daddy!

00:02:22.765 --> 00:02:23.808
Twenty-eight black!

00:02:29.313 --> 00:02:31.023
No, you don't.

00:02:31.106 --> 00:02:34.026
Last time you gambled,
you lost an arm and a leg. Literally!

00:02:34.109 --> 00:02:35.945
-Replacement limbs...
-I'll raise you 40.

00:02:36.028 --> 00:02:38.239
...aren't just lying around
like they were in the old days.

00:02:38.781 --> 00:02:40.741
So, no gambling.

00:02:40.825 --> 00:02:43.911
-Frank!
-Yes, dear! Got it! No gambling!

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:51.919
-Tinkles, stop.
-Wait.

00:02:52.169 --> 00:02:54.213
-Stop it, Tinkles, stop.
-Wait!

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:59.885
Have you guys seen Mavis?
I have to find her.

00:02:59.969 --> 00:03:01.053
Why? What's going on?

00:03:01.136 --> 00:03:03.180
I'm going to tell her about Ericka.

00:03:03.264 --> 00:03:05.891
I can't lie to my own daughter anymore.

00:03:05.975 --> 00:03:08.769
She's the most important person
in the world to me.

00:03:08.853 --> 00:03:10.855
I have to tell her the truth.

00:03:12.982 --> 00:03:14.900
Right after I talk to Ericka.

00:03:17.236 --> 00:03:18.237
Hey.

00:03:20.406 --> 00:03:21.448
All right, I'm all...

00:03:21.532 --> 00:03:23.951
Frank, are you sure
you know what you're doing?

00:03:24.034 --> 00:03:26.662
I got this. I'm all in.

00:03:29.874 --> 00:03:31.709
Johnny, have you seen my dad?

00:03:31.792 --> 00:03:34.378
-Maybe he's with Bob.
-Why would he be with Bob?

00:03:34.461 --> 00:03:35.754
Bob's a great guy.

00:03:36.463 --> 00:03:38.507
-There he is.
-Who? Bob?

00:03:55.983 --> 00:03:57.818
There he is! Hi, Bob!

